  "historyNote": "#5912, eff 10-14-94; ss by #6750, eff 5-19-98; ss by #8653, eff 6-9-06; ss by #10714, eff 11-7-14 (from Rev 705.03); ss by #14105, eff 10-29-24, EXPIRES: 10-29-34",
